{"id":"90beadd9d7ce40a3","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbpolarconflict.md","title":"Polar表示的冲突图为二部图","display":"thm-pbpolarconflict — Polar表示的冲突图为二部图","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbpolarconflict","aliases":["27-thm-pbpolarconflict"],"display":"thm-pbpolarconflict — Polar表示的冲突图为二部图","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbpolar]]","[[27-df-pbposiconflict]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.4","source_printed_pages":"604","source_pdf_pages":"628","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbpolarconflict"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbpolarconflict</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbpolarconflict — Polar表示的冲突图为二部图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec9751f6536e0aa8\" href=\"?note=ec9751f6536e0aa8\" title=\"27-df-pbpolar\">27-df-pbpolar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c5e4aaa7e95ef90\" href=\"?note=0c5e4aaa7e95ef90\" title=\"27-df-pbposiconflict\">27-df-pbposiconflict</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"604"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"628"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n\">\\(P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec9751f6536e0aa8\" href=\"?note=ec9751f6536e0aa8\" title=\"27-df-pbpolar\">27-df-pbpolar</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_P\">\\(E_P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c5e4aaa7e95ef90\" href=\"?note=0c5e4aaa7e95ef90\" title=\"27-df-pbposiconflict\">27-df-pbposiconflict</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:B_k=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad W\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:A_k=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:B_k=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad W\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:A_k=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U\\cap W=\\varnothing,\\qquad U\\cup W=[m],\\qquad\nE_P\\subseteq\\{\\{u,w\\}:u\\in U,w\\in W\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U\\cap W=\\varnothing,\\qquad U\\cup W=[m],\\qquad\nE_P\\subseteq\\{\\{u,w\\}:u\\in U,w\\in W\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>各项非空，故不可能同时A_k=B_k=∅。两个纯正项、两个纯负项都没有相反文字；边仅能跨两类。常数不作为图顶点。该结论解释原书将polar优化化为二部稳定集/网络流的路径，但本条不假装实现最大流程序。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbpolar","status":"resolved","id":"ec9751f6536e0aa8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbpolar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbposiconflict","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e4aaa7e95ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbposiconflict]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbpolar","status":"resolved","id":"ec9751f6536e0aa8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n$（[[27-df-pbpolar]]），$E_P$ 见 [[27-df-pbposiconflict]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbposiconflict","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e4aaa7e95ef90","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n$（[[27-df-pbpolar]]），$E_P$ 见 [[27-df-pbposiconflict]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n","display":false},{"tex":"E_P","display":false},{"tex":"U\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:B_k=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad W\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:A_k=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"U\\cap W=\\varnothing,\\qquad U\\cup W=[m],\\qquad\nE_P\\subseteq\\{\\{u,w\\}:u\\in U,w\\in W\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1337,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbpolarconflict|thm-pbpolarconflict — Polar表示的冲突图为二部图]]"}],"outgoing":["ec9751f6536e0aa8","0c5e4aaa7e95ef90"]}